  Title: CoinGame
  Prompt: At the intersection of two paths, you find a man sitting at a small table.
    Glancing up at you, he asks "Would you like to play a game of chance? I'm going
    to flip three coins. If you can correctly guess how many of them turn up heads,
    I'll double your bet. Let's make the bet 22 gold."
  Sprite: {fileID: 0}
  ChoicesToDisplay: 4
  Choices:
  - Text: 1 head.
    SuccessChance: 0.375
    _successText: Money
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: Good guess! I suppose I'm out of my luck for today. Gods bless ye.
      Outcomes:
      - Type: 1
        MoneyDelta: 44
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 0
        _numMapTiles: 0
    FailureOutcomeData:
      Text: Good guess! It looks like the gods favor me today. I'll be taking my
        gold.
      Outcomes:
      - Type: 1
        MoneyDelta: -22
        _equipment: {fileID: 0}
        _newHire: {fileID: 0}
        _damageAmount: 0
        _numMapTiles: 0
  - Text: 2 heads.
    SuccessChance: 0.375
    _successText: Money
    SuccessOutcomeData:
      Text: Good guess! I suppose I'm out of my luck for today. Gods bless ye.
      Outcomes:
      - Type: 1
